    {
      "id": "claim_622034f00c654c948db44da6dea724ba",
      "statement": "SeaweedFS runs as three independent containers (master, volume, filer) of the same chrislusf/seaweedfs image in compose.yml; the filer (port 8888) is the only role the backend communicates with, while volume and filer register themselves with the master.",
