      "statement": "SeaweedFS via these helpers backs course file uploads/deletion (api/src/courses/controllers/create.py and delete.py, path convention courses/{course_id}/{filename}), rich-text editor image uploads (api/src/editor_images/controllers.py, path editor-images/{uuid}{ext}, with content-type allow-list, 10MB cap, and path-traversal guards on filename), public resource attachments (api/src/publicDB/resources/controllers), and course-generator agent source file loading (agents/course_generator/nodes/load_data.py).",
