      "id": "claim_99948496c48b4180a2b4fdc1e64552ac",
      "statement": "agents/base/llm.py's get_llm_config(db, key, default_model, default_prompt) looks up an active SystemSetting row by key to obtain per-role model/prompt configuration managed by Super Admins, falling back to caller-supplied defaults if no active row exists, or raising ValueError if neither exists; every LangGraph agent node (course_generator planner/summarize, mentor generate_answer/rerank, assessment_generator/evaluator, practice_question_generator/evaluator, sql_agent, wiki mentor) obtains its model this way rather than instantiating a chat client directly.",
