    {
      "id": "claim_1137112b1cfd4a26b44677563f1e8a17",
      "statement": "create_chat_llm(model, temperature, max_tokens) selects ChatAnthropic when model starts with 'claude' and ChatOpenAI otherwise; for Anthropic models it never forwards temperature (current Claude models reject it with HTTP 400) and always sets max_tokens explicitly (default 16000, DEFAULT_ANTHROPIC_MAX_TOKENS) to avoid langchain-anthropic's per-model default table silently truncating structured output, enabling streaming when the resolved max_tokens exceeds the default to avoid HTTP timeouts on large non-streamed responses.",
