      "id": "claim_9c334db5afd24f73834deac72655d3be",
      "statement": "LLM provider API keys (ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, OPENAI_API_KEY) are not part of the backend's pydantic Settings in backend/api/config.py; they are read directly from the process environment by the langchain-anthropic/langchain-openai SDKs, sourced from the repo's top-level .env file loaded into the api container via compose.yml's env_file directive, so a missing/invalid key surfaces only as a runtime SDK authentication error rather than a startup configuration error.",
